---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---
<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Peptide Source Hub privacy policy — how we collect, use, and protect your information.">
<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container-narrow mx-auto px-4">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2">Last updated: 2026</p>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-gray-700">
      <div class="card"><h2 class="font-bold mb-2">Information We Collect</h2><p>We collect information you provide when contacting us: name, email, company details, phone number, and project requirements. We do not sell or share your information with third parties.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h2 class="font-bold mb-2">How We Use Your Information</h2><p>Your information is used solely to respond to inquiries, process orders, and provide ongoing customer support related to your business with Peptide Source Hub.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h2 class="font-bold mb-2">Data Protection</h2><p>We implement appropriate security measures to protect your personal and business information.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h2 class="font-bold mb-2">Contact</h2><p>For privacy-related inquiries: <a href="mailto:aaron@senobiocorp.com">aaron@senobiocorp.com</a></p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</PageLayout>
